# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Vendor demo downloads. These are tens of megabytes of zip and extracted
# examples, re-downloadable from the Waveshare wiki. What we actually need
# tracked is the driver baseline we diff our patches against, which is copied
# to devices/*/vendor-baseline/ and is a few hundred kilobytes.
vendor/

